# Deliberately minimal.
#
# The instruction for this repository was to include everything. This file lists
# only what GitHub will physically REFUSE, plus machine-local state that cannot
# mean anything on another computer. Nothing here is source, configuration,
# documentation, a test, an asset, or a dependency manifest.
#
# ── Rejected by GitHub, not a preference ─────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100 MB. app/build alone contains:
#     346 MB  libflutter.so (x86_64 debug)
#     163 MB  mergeJavaRes zip-cache
#     151 MB  app-debug.apk
#     141 MB  libflutter.so (x86_64 release)
#     111 MB  intermediary-bundle.aab
#      78 MB  app.dill  x2, kernel_blob.bin x2
# A push containing them fails outright. Together they are 3.3 GB of the 3.4 GB
# working tree, and every byte is regenerated by `flutter build`.
#
# They are also the reason to exclude them even if they fit: app.dill and
# kernel_blob.bin are compiled snapshots of lib/, so they embed the
# --dart-define values used to build them, including the dev-login password.
app/build/
app/.dart_tool/
app/android/.gradle/
app/android/app/.cxx/
app/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
app/ios/Pods/
app/ios/.symlinks/
app/macos/Pods/
app/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
app/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
app/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# ── The retired Node/Express + MySQL tier ────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing points at it. Reads go to PostgREST views, writes to RPC, auth to
# GoTrue. It stays on disk because it is still the only copy of the old system
# until the MariaDB data is migrated, but it is not part of this app any more.
#
# Excluding it also keeps api/.env — JWT_SECRET and the MySQL credentials — out
# of git history entirely.
api/

# ── Machine-local, meaningless elsewhere ─────────────────────────────────────
# Points at an absolute path on one Windows user account.
app/.idea/
.vscode/settings.json
*.iml

# The portable PostgreSQL the probe suite provisions. ~1 GB, and
# supabase/tests/local_pg.sh recreates it on any machine.
.localpg/

# OS noise.
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ── NOT ignored, on purpose ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# assets/, app/assets/  the bundled Tajawal and Cairo fonts
# supabase/             migrations, the probe suite, APPLY_TO_SUPABASE.sql
# app/test/fixtures/    real wire JSON the contract tests parse
# .claude/              the skills this project was built with
# index.html            the original prototype, still the parity oracle
